  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given, product of magnitudes is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p><p>Also given&nbsp;angles between any two of them is same</p><p>So, angle between&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Now solving <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Similarly for&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now adding equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>168</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>168</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>168</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
